    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Exceptional two bedroom second floor open plan dual aspect apartment with two balconies, two ensuites and a designated car space.\r\n\r\nThis amazing property features an L shaped entrance hall with semi-solid floors, a TV Intercom and a fully tiled guest w.c. with built in storage. To the right of the hallway is a spacious master bedroom semi-solid floors, sophisticated fitted wardrobes & shelving, spotlights, floor to ceiling windows and a sliding door to a tiled balcony, the perfect place for a morning coffee. The master bedroom also incorporates a fully tiled ensuite bathroom with a built in mirror, under sink storage and a towel radiator. The generous sized second bedroom also enjoys semi-solid flooring, fitted wardrobes & shelving, spotlights, floor to ceiling windows and access to a south west facing balcony. It's stylish ensuite is fully tiled, has high spec sanitary ware and built in storage. The stylish open plan living room & dining area is a light filled space with a large storage/utility room, semi-solid flooring, spotlights, a large window and access to the south west facing balcony, an ideal spot for those long summer afternoons & evenings. The accommodation is completed a fully integrated U shaped kitchen a tiled floor and plenty of counter & cupboard space. This stunning apartment also benefits from an underground designated car space and is serviced by a lift.\r\n\r\nThe Hibernia Building is ideally located in Heuston South Quarter which enjoys a concierge service and a range of amenities such as Super Valu, Insomnia, HSQ Cafe, HSQ Pharmacy, Anytime Fitness GYM, Safari Childcare, HSQ Hub and Heuston Laundrette. Heuston Station is a short stroll away making the city centre and national routes easily accessible. The Phoenix Park & Memorial Gardens are both closeby providing excellent outdoor leisure facilities. The New Children's Hospital at St. James's is also within walking distance. Kilmainham itself is a very popular city suburb and boasts some excellent pubs and restaurants.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\nYear of construction 2008\r\nNo rent caps\r\n2nd floor\r\nDual aspect\r\n2 balconies\r\n2 ensuites & guest w.c.\r\nDesignated car space\r\nFully integrated kitchen\r\nSought after development"
      },
